// =============================================================================
// CarePulse - Microsoft Fabric Eventhouse Schema & JSON Ingestion Mappings
// Source Kafka topic prefix: synthea.<table>
// Paste into Eventhouse KQL Queryset, click inside line 6+, and press Run ONCE.
